# 🎓 Student Marks Analysis using MySQL #

## 📌 Project Overview
This project analyzes student marks across five subjects:
Tamil, English, Mathematics, Science, and Social Science.

## 🛠️ Tools Used
- MySQL
- MySQL Workbench

## 💻 SQL Concepts Used
- Database and Table Creation
- INSERT INTO and SELECT
- CASE WHEN for Pass/Fail
- Total Marks Calculation
- Percentage Calculation using ROUND()
- RANK() Window Function
- Aggregate Functions: COUNT(), AVG(), MAX(), MIN()
- GROUP BY and HAVING
- WHERE Clause

## 📊 Key Features
- Calculate total marks and percentages.
- Identify students as Pass or Fail.
- Rank students based on total marks.
- Analyze average, highest, and lowest marks.
- Filter student records using SQL conditions.

## 🎯 Learning Outcome
Practiced SQL queries to analyze student performance
and generate meaningful results.

